flowchart TB
  accTitle: Level 1 static routing in practice
  accDescr: Manifests, a registry, and a profile compile into a small prompt-visible set of domain routers. For each request, deterministic exact aliases and keyword rules select one off-prompt leaf skill. The runtime inspects and activates that exact skill, then loads a named resource only when its condition is met. Ambiguous requests stop for clarification.

  subgraph build["Compile the routing surface"]
    direction LR
    S["<b>Skill sources</b><br/>Manifests · registry · profile"]
    C["<b>Deterministic compiler</b><br/>Validate IDs · apply policy<br/>bind source digests"]
    R["<b>Prompt-visible routers</b><br/>Engineering · Data<br/>small stable surface"]
    S --> C --> R
  end

  subgraph request["Route one request"]
    direction LR
    Q["<b>User request</b><br/>Analyze this table<br/>and chart it"]
    M["<b>Static match</b><br/>Exact alias · keywords<br/>ambiguity → clarify"]
    L["<b>Select and inspect</b><br/>Off-prompt table-analysis<br/>exact manifest and version"]
    A["<b>Activate selected skill</b><br/>Load chart-guidance.md only<br/>because the request needs it"]

    Q --> M --> L --> A
    M -.-> H["<b>Stop and clarify</b><br/>No guessed activation"]
  end

  build --> request

  classDef source fill:#ECEEF0,stroke:#607D8B,color:#13343B,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef agent fill:#20808D,stroke:#187078,color:#FFFFFF,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef policy fill:#FFF3E0,stroke:#C47530,color:#13343B,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef selected fill:#E8F4F6,stroke:#187078,color:#13343B,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef stop fill:#FFF3E0,stroke:#C47530,color:#13343B,stroke-width:2px;

  class S source;
  class C,R,M agent;
  class Q policy;
  class L,A selected;
  class H stop;

  style build fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#CBD5DA,stroke-width:1px
  style request fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#CBD5DA,stroke-width:1px
